<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 598.02, down 4.02.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 354 to 164.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.10.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,033,195 compared with 19,501,495 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
